	<variable name="Dlg_SkinHelp">
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9550)">When Daylight changes its colours, what counts as bedtime, and whether the weather may pick a row.[CR][CR]Up / Down picks a group, Right enters it.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9551)">How much of each film's own colour reaches the page, and the small markers on posters.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9552)">How the playback controls behave.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9553)">Motion, and a way back to the defaults.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9510)">Auto follows the clock: pale morning (6-11), bright afternoon (11-17), amber evening (17-22) and a dim deep-blue night (22-6). Pick one to keep it all day.[CR][CR]Greetings and suggestions always follow the real time.[CR][CR]Daylight reads Kodi's own clock, the one at the top right. If that is wrong, set the time zone on your device, or in Kodi under Settings &gt; Interface &gt; Regional where it is offered.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9511)">Home counts down to it, the first card shows films that end before it, and the playback controls tell you when a film runs past it. Midnight says "midnight".</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9512)">When it rains or snows, the third card on Home suggests something long and a few slow streaks drift over the page. Off keeps the weather in the top line only.[CR][CR]The weather comes from a weather add-on chosen in Kodi under Settings &gt; Services &gt; Weather. Without one, Daylight simply leaves the weather out.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9520)">TMDb Helper reads the colour of the focused poster and Daylight lets it glow softly behind the page, gentler at night.[CR][CR]Needs TMDb Helper; Off uses nothing.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9521)">Unwatched: a small dot. Watched: a check disc. Shows add the number of unwatched episodes.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9522)">Shows a Trailer button next to Play when a film has a trailer link (played through the YouTube add-on).</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9530)">How long the playback controls stay up after your last button press. They stay while paused and while a menu is open.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9531)">Where the subtitle and audio offset strip appears while you sync. Top keeps bottom subtitles in view.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9540)">Replaces zooms, slides and the rain with short fades. Focus changes stay instant.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9541)">Puts every Daylight setting back to its default and reloads the skin. Press OK twice to confirm.</value>
